        "Background": "Raised from childhood by the assassins of Clan Cave Fox, Shou never had to grow up — his skill let him treat killing as a game. He spent years close to his fellow assassin Raine, until Raine broke from the Clan. Now Shou has been sent to track his old friend down, and he's treating the hunt as the best game yet.",
        "Personality": "Cheerful, playful, and utterly without remorse, Shou brings a childlike energy to a very adult occupation. He's easily won over by food, at least for a little while."
